OL,3,GNEWSA'Unmistakably' Sunderland artwork
OL,4,Abegins chiming
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artwork which changes every hour and
OL,7,Faims to celebrate the identity of a
OL,8,Fcity "on the brink of embracing a lot
OL,9,Fof change" has been officially
OL,10,Funveiled.
OL,12,FOver the next year, Timepiece will see
OL,13,Fdifferent 50-second long collages made
OL,14,Ffrom archive film, photos and audio
OL,15,Fchime on the hour through Sunderland's
OL,16,Fnewly opened Culture House.
OL,18,FThe piece, which was created by Jeremy
OL,19,FBradfield, Ben Lawrence and The
OL,20,FFutureheads' Ross Millard, is one of
OL,21,Fthe first major artworks to go on show
OL,22,Fat the venue.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
